[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/85167786","html_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/7847#issuecomment-85167786","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/7847","id":85167786,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg1MTY3Nzg2","user":{"login":"nineinchnick","id":795177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NTE3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/795177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick","html_url":"https://github.com/nineinchnick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-03-23T19:55:06Z","updated_at":"2015-03-23T19:55:06Z","body":"This does look like a bug, but when I was thinking about how to properly cast numbers to string when there is precision/scale defined for them in the db I thought you shouldn't store numbers with fixed precision as doubles in PHP in the first place. In some corner cases they will have to be rounded to the fixed precision.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/85167786/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nineinchnick","id":795177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NTE3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/795177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick","html_url":"https://github.com/nineinchnick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/85171642","html_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/7847#issuecomment-85171642","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/7847","id":85171642,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg1MTcxNjQy","user":{"login":"nineinchnick","id":795177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NTE3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/795177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick","html_url":"https://github.com/nineinchnick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-03-23T20:08:40Z","updated_at":"2015-03-23T20:09:21Z","body":"After quick googling it looks like all DB's expect numbers with a dot as a decimal separator, regardless of locale, as SQL standard.\n\nI was thinking about using `number_format()` when `scale` is set but following [PostgreSQL docs on numeric](http://www.postgresql.org/docs/9.1/static/datatype-numeric.html) there can be `NUMERIC` db type without scale. In other cases the db performs rounding and typechecking itself, so it's not necessary to be too precise here.\n\nSo it's just about casting to string with a constant dot decimal separator.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/85171642/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nineinchnick","id":795177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NTE3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/795177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick","html_url":"https://github.com/nineinchnick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/85389830","html_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/7847#issuecomment-85389830","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/7847","id":85389830,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg1Mzg5ODMw","user":{"login":"bviolier","id":1247610,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDc2MTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1247610?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier","html_url":"https://github.com/bviolier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-03-24T08:04:36Z","updated_at":"2015-03-24T08:05:15Z","body":"Your findings seem indeed to be correct. Thanks for researching the issue.\nA temporary fix for us would be to check if the $this->type === 'decimal' and then do a str_replace(\",\", \".\" $value) after the (string).\n\nAnd I'm not sure I following your PostgreSQL comment. Wouldn't it be possible to always use number_format according to the scale variable? In the case of a numeric without scale, the decimal count would be 0. Although it would indeed seem overkill of the DB always performs the rounding itself.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/85389830/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"bviolier","id":1247610,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDc2MTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1247610?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier","html_url":"https://github.com/bviolier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bviolier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":263233895,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDI2MzIzMzg5NQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/events/263233895","actor":{"login":"samdark","id":47294,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3Mjk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47294?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark","html_url":"https://github.com/samdark","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2015-03-24T08:16:00Z","label":{"name":"status:under discussion","color":"f7c6c7"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":263233908,"node_id":"MDE1Ok1pbGVzdG9uZWRFdmVudDI2MzIzMzkwOA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/events/263233908","actor":{"login":"samdark","id":47294,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3Mjk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47294?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark","html_url":"https://github.com/samdark","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"milestoned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2015-03-24T08:16:02Z","milestone":{"title":"2.0.x"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/85402976","html_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/7847#issuecomment-85402976","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/7847","id":85402976,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg1NDAyOTc2","user":{"login":"nineinchnick","id":795177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NTE3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/795177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick","html_url":"https://github.com/nineinchnick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nineinchnick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-03-24T08:42:24Z","updated_at":"2015-03-24T08:42:24Z","body":"It's not only decimal. All numeric types needs to be detected properly. I think a str_replace() is sufficient here.\n\nFrom the PostgreSQL manual:\n\n> Specifying: `NUMERIC` without any precision or scale creates a column in which numeric values of any precision and scale can be stored, up to the implementation limit on precision. A column of this kind will not coerce input values to any particular scale, whereas numeric columns with a declared scale will coerce input values to that scale. (The SQL standard requires a default scale of 0, i.e., coercion to integer precision. We find this a bit useless. If you're concerned about portability, always specify the precision and scale explicitly.)\n\nSo I'd say we shouldn't do any kind of rounding and leave it to the db.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/85402976/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented"